# 1. Ignore absolutely everything by default
*

# 2. Allow Git to look inside folders (otherwise it ignores your subdirectories entirely)
!*/

# 3. Whitelist only your source files, markdown notes, and configuration files
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.md
!.gitignore

# Optional: If you use VS Code tasks/settings, whitelist the .vscode folder
!/.vscode/